{"id":"wb-4-50","name":"锁阳城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"锁阳城遗址","text":"锁阳城遗址，位于中国甘肃省酒泉市瓜州县锁阳城镇南坝村，河西走廊西端，现为全国重点文物保护单位。锁阳城遗址始建于汉代，兴于唐代，名字来源于当地盛产的锁阳草，1524年因嘉峪关闭关而废弃。锁阳城是中国保存最完好的汉唐古城之一，包含古城址、古河道、古寺院、古墓葬、古垦区等多种遗迹。2014年，该遗址被列为世界文化遗产“丝绸之路：长安-天山廊道路网”的组成部分。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%94%81%E9%98%B3%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92634452,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92634452","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/30c4c868ca3785d008ed50d8.jpg","title":"Suoyang_City_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Suoyang_City_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/Suoyang_City_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zanhe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​锁阳城遗址","width":320,"height":240}}